  cff-version: 1.2.0
  title: "Fitbauer"
  abstract: >-
    Open-source desktop application to load, fold, simulate and fit 57Fe Mössbauer
    spectra. Provides a maintained replacement for the legacy NORMOS program,
    preserving compatibility with its data files and adding 2D distributions,
    advanced regularization, Monte Carlo error estimation and batch fitting.
